# Response headers for this site, read by Reliant static hosting at deploy
# time (Netlify / Cloudflare Pages format; the file itself is never served).
# It ships in the build, so a promoted release serves the same headers in
# every env. Reference: `forge skill load deploy/static-site`, "Response
# headers".
#
# Only this site may frame its pages: another origin cannot put a sign-in or
# settings page under a transparent iframe and click it for the user
# (clickjacking). To allow an embedder, list it, e.g.
#   Content-Security-Policy: frame-ancestors 'self' https://partner.example
# and delete the X-Frame-Options line (browsers that know frame-ancestors
# ignore it; older ones would still refuse the embedder).
/*
  Content-Security-Policy: frame-ancestors 'self'
  X-Frame-Options: SAMEORIGIN
